<Speakers>
<Speaker id="spk1" name="Eleuterio Gorostiza Salazar" check="no" dialect="native" accent="" scope="local"/>
<Speaker id="spk2" name="Eugenia Samitez Lucas" check="no" dialect="native" accent="" scope="local"/>
</Speakers>
<Episode>
<Section type="report" startTime="0" endTime="561.208">
<Turn startTime="0" endTime="5.718" speaker="spk1">
<Sync time="0"/>
Ekintsi:n na:nah xite:chtapowi ke:ní:w teh tikchi:wa chikola:ato:l
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="5.718" endTime="18.937">
<Sync time="5.718"/>
Pos se: kitsetsetselowa wa:n se: kimana ya, se: kitsopelia, se: kita:lilia chikola:t,
<Sync time="13.046"/>
ke:mah moloni a, se: ki:xtia ya, se: tayi a.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="18.937" endTime="42.125">
<Sync time="18.937"/>
Wa:n xokoato:l ke:ní:w se: kichi:wa.
<Sync time="22.875"/>
Yeh no: se: kalaxowa, yeh tao:l se: kipaya:na, ke:meh ya..., ke:meh a:man se: kipaya:na, okyowa se: kichi:was.
<Sync time="29.875"/>
Okyowa se: kalaxowa wa:n se: kitsetselowa ya, se: kimana ya,
<Sync time="34.156"/>
se: kimolo:ntia ya, se: kitsopelia, molo:ni wa:n mah se: tayi a, yeh a:mo teh se: kita:lia, iwki sah.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="42.125" endTime="44.957">
<Sync time="42.125"/>
A:mo se: kitsope:lia
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="44.957" endTime="47.781">
<Sync time="44.957"/>
Se: kitsope:lia sah.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="47.781" endTime="50.791">
<Sync time="47.781"/>
Ista:kato:l, ke:ní:w se: kichi:wa.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="50.791" endTime="66.604">
<Sync time="50.791"/>
Yeh yo:n alaxtik n' tixtsi:n wa:n a:mo tsope:k, yehwa tikiliah ista:kato:l,
<Sync time="58.666"/>
pachato:l se: kipaya:na wa:n se: kimana.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="66.604" endTime="93.063">
<Sync time="66.604"/>
I:n kapolato:l ke:ní:w tikchi:wa.
<Sync time="70.766"/>
Yeh se: kima:pata kapolin 
<Sync time="73.344"/>
wa:n ke:mah se: kipa:ta ya tixtsi:n wa:n se: kitsetselowilia ya ne:n tix..., tixa:t n' kapolin,
<Sync time="82.36"/>
ke:mah se: kima:nelowa ya, se: kitikoketsa wa:n molo:ni a
<Sync time="87.501"/>
se: kitsope:lia wa:n molo:ni, kwali a.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="93.063" endTime="96.864">
<Sync time="93.063"/>
Wa:n i:n mo:rahato:l.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="96.864" endTime="123.178">
<Sync time="96.864"/>
No: *igual**, no: se: kimax..., no: se: kima:pa:ta *moras** oksik, tein kwahkwali oksik sah,
<Sync time="104.288"/>
ke:mah se: kipa:ta tixtsi:n no: wa:n se: kima:nelowa iwa:n no:,
<Sync time="111.475"/>
no: se: kitsetselowa wa:n se: kimolo:ntia ya.
<Sync time="116.334"/>
Yo:n a:mo kipia *más** teisá:, i:pa no: se: kitsopelia sah.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="123.178" endTime="127.397">
<Sync time="123.178"/>
E:lo:ato:l, ¿ke:ní:w se: kichi:wa?
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="127.397" endTime="139.038">
<Sync time="127.397"/>
Yeh se 'kwe:chowa no: ika metat e:lo:tao:l wa:n no: se: kitsetselowa wa:n se: kimolo:ntia ya.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1 spk2" startTime="139.038" endTime="147.96">
<Sync time="139.038"/>
<Who nb="1"/>
¿Se: kitsope:lia oso a:mo?
<Who nb="2"/>
Ke:mah, no: se: kitsope:lia mahyá: e:lo:tamal.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="147.96" endTime="150.866">
<Sync time="147.96"/>
¿Wa:n i:n kaxtapa:nkamohato:l?
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="150.866" endTime="169.382">
<Sync time="150.866"/>
Yeh no: se: 'kwe:chowa n' kamoh, kwaltsi:n se: kipa:ka, wa:n se: 'kwiti ka:mpa onkak wa:n 
<Sync time="157.647"/>
kwaltsi:n se: kipa:ka wa:n ne:n tixato:l mah molo:nto ya, ato:ltapaya:n,
<Sync time="163.272"/>
ke:mah se: kipantsetselowilia ya sah wa:n se: kitsope:lia. Kwali a.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1 spk2" startTime="169.382" endTime="175.835">
<Sync time="169.382"/>
<Who nb="1"/>
Tiweli t'chihchi:wa metsonkilkamohato:l 
<Who nb="2"/>
Yeh no: niweli, se: kipa:ta kwaltsi:n.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="175.835" endTime="194.913">
<Sync time="175.835"/>
Wa:n se: kipanketsa ya mah molo:ni, yeh a:mo kwi:ka tixti, yeh iwki sah.
<Sync time="181.788"/>
Yeh iwki sah se: kichi:wa, se: kita:lilia tepitsi:n *chili:toh** wa:n kwali a
<Sync time="189.46"/>
se: kimolo:ntia, se: kitsope:lia.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="194.913" endTime="199.43">
<Sync time="194.913"/>
I:n a:tol, kamohato:l ke:ní:w se: kichi:wa
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="199.43" endTime="212.179">
<Sync time="199.43"/>
Yeh iwk..., yeh sayoh se: kitsetselowa tixtsi:n wa:n se: kitsetselowa ya kamoh, no: se: kwe:chowa,
<Sync time="207.397"/>
wa:n ke:mah se: kitsope:lia, se: kitikoketsa ya.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="212.179" endTime="215.546">
<Sync time="212.179"/>
I:n *este** yo:lohxo:chia:to:l.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="215.546" endTime="227.249">
<Sync time="215.546"/>
Yo:n no: tatsetselo:l tixtsi:n, alaxtik wa:n se: kipankalakilia yo:n xo:chitsi:n teyin yo:n wahwa:kik a, teyi:n yo:n ahwia:k.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="227.249" endTime="229.801">
<Sync time="227.249"/>
Wa:n i:n oksé: *vainillayahto:l**.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="229.801" endTime="250.668">
<Sync time="229.801"/>
I:n no: se: kipankalakilia sah ne:n *vainilla**,
<Sync time="233.18"/>
se: kitsetselowa tixtsi:n wa:n se: kiketsa itech se: ko:mit a oso *olla** wa:n
<Sync time="240.71"/>
ke:mah se: kip..., i:xtapa:na ne:n *vainilla** 
<Sync time="245.481"/>
wa:n se: kipankalakilia ya, se: kitsope:lia, mah ahwia:ya.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="250.668" endTime="255.231">
<Sync time="250.668"/>
Okseki ato:l tein teh tiweli.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="255.231" endTime="262.043">
<Sync time="255.231"/>
Yehwa sah ne:n, yehwa sah, de *más, más** ato:l, *solo** tein takowal a.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1 spk2" startTime="262.043" endTime="264.507">
<Sync time="262.043"/>
<Who nb="1"/>
Katí:n ato:l takowal.
<Who nb="2"/>
Ne:n.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="264.507" endTime="273.95">
<Sync time="264.507"/>
Yehwa ya tein name:chilihtoya, *arroz** wa:n ne:n....
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="273.95" endTime="279.436">
<Sync time="273.95"/>
Ke:ní:w se: kichi:wa ne:n *arroz**
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="279.436" endTime="288.934">
<Sync time="279.436"/>
*Arroz**, pos yeh se: kimana, iwki mahmasitok, ata se: kichi:wa ato:l, 
<Sync time="284.575"/>
seki wa:n seki se: 'kwe:chowa kwali no:.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="288.934" endTime="292.068">
<Sync time="288.934"/>
I:pa yehwa sah tein takowal tiweli
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="292.068" endTime="394.232">
<Sync time="292.068"/>
Yehwa sah wa:n yo:n *avena** se: kichi:wa,
<Sync time="296.918"/>
yo:n de *sabores** ato:l, pero yeh, yeh nochi takowal se: kita:lilia,
<Sync time="306.371"/>
tixtsi:n nochi tixtsi:n se: kikwi.
<Sync time="311.418"/>
Wa:n a:xokot yehwa se: kichi:wa, se: ki..., se: kikwi se: ko:mit tein yankwik,
<Sync time="320.491"/>
wa:n tsiktsi:n tenextsi:n se: kikwi, kwaltsi:n tapa:tal, tepitsi:n se: kiihtiohsa
<Sync time="326.521"/>
wa:n ompa se: 'kwe:chowa yo:n a:xokoxiwit, xa: nanki:xmattoskeh.
<Sync time="331.086"/>
Se: 'kwe:chowa se: we:i *rollo** wa:n ke:mah ika se: kiihtixakwalowa ya ko:mit
<Sync time="336.302"/>
wa:n se: kiketsa tepitsi:n mah yeto
<Sync time="341.122"/>
wa:n ke:mah se: 'kwe:chowa ya tixts..., se: kimana ya tio:tak ato:l.
<Sync time="346.966"/>
Se: kipaya:na sah, a:mo se: kalaxowa, ke:mah se: kimolo:ntia, ompa se: kipantsonkepa ya.
<Sync time="353.966"/>
Ke:mah se: kite:ntsakwa ya ika miak xiwit ika yo:n po:xnexiwit
<Sync time="358.778"/>
wa:n iswat ompa paniá:n yowi, teisá: se: kipantsonke:ntia, tilmah oso naylon
<Sync time="365.513"/>
wa:n ke:mah se: kite:ntsopo:l
<Comment desc="quizá quiso decir kite:ntsakwa"/>
 ika se: *tablita**, ompa mah kochi a.
<Sync time="371.797"/>
Mo:stika se: kita komo aya:mo ahwia:k, aya:mo poposokatok,
<Sync time="375.766"/>
entó:s aya:mo se: kitsope:lia ya pero komo se: kita kwali a, se: kixe:xelowa ya
<Sync time="381.279"/>
komo aya:mo *hasta** wiptika, ke:mah, kwaltia ya, mochi:wa ya a:xokot a.
<Sync time="388.143"/>
Se: kiki:x..., se: kixe:xelo, se: kitsopelia ya.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="394.232" endTime="401.291">
<Sync time="394.232"/>
I:n a:xokot se: kitsope:lia *hasta** mah i:xpoposoka.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="401.291" endTime="411.753">
<Sync time="401.291"/>
*Hasta** mah, *hasta cuando** se: tai a, se: kitsope:lihtiw, ke:mah, se: kite:ntsakwa a:mo tsope:k, iwki sah ato:l.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="411.753" endTime="416.865">
<Sync time="411.753"/>
Wa:n ke:ní:w se: kekowa ke we:lik a eski, mah se: kitsope:lia.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="416.865" endTime="431.222">
<Sync time="416.865"/>
We:lik a, k..., yehwa ya yo:n, seki kihtowah ka:n kwe:liliah ata kihtowah kwitahya:k, iwki te:iliah, mm.
<Sync time="424.925"/>
Pero seki se: tayi, se: kwe:lilia se: tayi:s.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="431.222" endTime="435.315">
<Sync time="431.222"/>
Ihwa:k teh timoskaltih ke..., katí:n *tiempo** taya:yah a:xokot.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="435.315" endTime="445.644">
<Sync time="435.315"/>
I:pa t..., tehwa:n, tehwa:n 'senchi:wtoyah ne: ka:mpa nimoskaltih,
<Sync time="440.147"/>
i:pa 'chi:wayah sah para 'tai:skeh.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="445.644" endTime="451.394">
<Sync time="445.644"/>
Se: ato:l tein teh tiwelis.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="451.394" endTime="457.738">
<Sync time="451.394"/>
Yehwa sah, yehwa sah i:pa nik..., nik..., nikchi:wa kit ato:l.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="457.738" endTime="463.831">
<Sync time="457.738"/>
*Bueno** koma:mo tikelna:miki ok se: ato:l kwali 'te:chili:s moto:kay.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="463.831" endTime="480.499">
<Sync time="463.831"/>
*Solo** ato:l *más** se: kichi:wa de yo:n *cuando** se: mokokowa, 
<Sync time="469.801"/>
se: tayi yo:n tsi:katao:ltsi:n, se: kitewa:tsa wa:n se: kwechowa
<Sync time="474.343"/>
wa:n se: kimolo:ntia koma:li:xko, no: ato:l pero para pahti.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1 spk2" startTime="480.499" endTime="485.723">
<Sync time="480.499"/>
<Who nb="1"/>
I:pa *este** tao:l sah se: kikwi *o** teisá: *más**
<Who nb="2"/>
Taoltsi:n sah, tsi:katao:ltsi:n.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="485.723" endTime="497.028">
<Sync time="485.723"/>

Se: kikwe:chowa kwaltsi:n wa:n se: kimolo:ntia itech koma:l,
<Sync time="489.927"/>
wa:n ke:mah se: kite:ka ya itech se: *taza** wa:n se: kimaka ya a:kin mokokowa, ke:mah.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="497.028" endTime="498.813">
<Sync time="497.028"/>
Ton kokolisyo kipahtia.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="498.813" endTime="511.689">
<Sync time="498.813"/>
Kalanemi:lis, yehwa kipahtia:ya wehka:w,
<Sync time="502.819"/>
a:man a:mo, neli a:man neli ke:meh kihtowa ne: *nocomadre**, a:mo kikwih ok pahti de kalampa.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="511.689" endTime="515.946">
<Sync time="511.689"/>
Ka:n tikelna:miki ok teisá: oksé: ato:l.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="515.946" endTime="532.163">
<Sync time="515.946"/>
Pos *solo** yehwa ya tein ke:meh i:n at..., yehwa ya yo:n nankihtokeh e..., e:lo:ixwakato:l, yeh tikihkwiloh ya, kanah,
<Sync time="525.088"/>
ke:mah yehwa ya wa:n yehwa ya yo:n nochi e:lo:ato:l, nochi a.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="532.163" endTime="536.896">
<Sync time="532.163"/>
*Bueno** koma:mo tikelna:miki ok oksé: ato:l, kwali 'te:chili:s moto:ka:y.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="536.896" endTime="540.499">
<Sync time="536.896"/>
Eugenia Samitez Lucas.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="540.499" endTime="542.564">
<Sync time="540.499"/>
Ka:nachi xiwit tikpia.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="542.564" endTime="551.57">
<Sync time="542.564"/>
Ata, ata nimitsilwih ye:wa e:yi powal wa:n mahtak ika e:yi xiwit.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="551.57" endTime="553.929">
<Sync time="551.57"/>
Wa:n katí:n xola:l tiwa:le:wa.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="553.929" endTime="556.17">
<Sync time="553.929"/>
San Miguel Tzinacapan.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="556.17" endTime="561.208">
<Sync time="556.17"/>
*Bueno** pos tasohka:matik.
</Turn>
